      <title>Man sentenced in federal drug case</title>
      <link>https://www.wkbn.com/news/local-news/youngstown-news/man-sentenced-in-federal-drug-case/</link>
      <description>District Judge Sara Lioi sentenced Jonathan Streb to 41 months in prison to be served at the same time as his two-year prison sentence in his Mahoning County cases, though he received credit for 171 days already served in those cases. He was also sentenced to three years of probation, according to court records.</description>
